      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Situated in eastern Jackson County, Tarsney Lakes lies just south of the West Fork of Sni‑A‑Bar Creek and surrounds two lakes, Tarsney and Wood.",
